// can alter the properties of `ObjMaker.prototype` to add to both the
// `prototype` and `[[prototype]]`). The `ObjMaker` function was executed, with
// `obj1` in place of `this`... so `obj1.a` was set to 'first'.

obj1.a;
// returns 'first'
obj1.b;
