Updated answer

Here's an update as of 2016 and 
widespread deployment of ES5(http://kangax.github.io/compat-table/es5/)
 and beyond.
  For IE9+ and all other modern ES5+ capable browsers, you can use 
`Object.keys()`(https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Object/keys)
